{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/7779347b4db845615ea95549bdfed646.avif?t=1774622878\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras_big/7779347b4db845615ea95549bdfed646.webp?t=1774622878 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Tactical-RPG</strong> where you <strong>customize each attack</strong> by mixing <strong>magic ingredients</strong> together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INGREDIENTS COMBO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/c167b860bff08fc595d4f13aa22e452b.poster.avif?t=1774622878\" width=1170 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/c167b860bff08fc595d4f13aa22e452b.webm?t=1774622878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/c167b860bff08fc595d4f13aa22e452b.mp4?t=1774622878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Blend magic ingredients with<strong> unique effects</strong> to <strong>shoot special splashes </strong>with your <strong>trusty cauldron.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the <strong>perfect combos</strong>\u00a0to deal with the chaotic situations on hands to get the upper hand against wild meanie creatures! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RICH ENVIRONMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/1be40c1071f172f32395cec46e425724.poster.avif?t=1774622878\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/1be40c1071f172f32395cec46e425724.webm?t=1774622878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/1be40c1071f172f32395cec46e425724.mp4?t=1774622878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>collect various ingredients</strong> anywhere! Pick them off the ground, shake them from bushes or even retrieve them from the fresh parts of your foolish enemies to turn their own strength against them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful though, the environment isn't as friendly as it seems. From <strong>explosive plants</strong> to <strong>giant hungry worms</strong> digging holes everywhere, don't go wandering willy nilly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARNING IS ITS OWN GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/09befdb8c4a83f0a89b774e92f844c8a.poster.avif?t=1774622878\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/09befdb8c4a83f0a89b774e92f844c8a.webm?t=1774622878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/09befdb8c4a83f0a89b774e92f844c8a.mp4?t=1774622878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges in the form of environment puzzles that keep the\u00a0<strong>fight mechanics</strong>\u00a0to learn new tricks and <strong>unlock special abilities</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/b1e98df20677989dce4d96b88cce0010.avif?t=1774622878\" width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cauldron Union already has its fair share of issues to deal with, but the ominous bubbling coming from the rivers might be their biggest problem yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Romvald the little Vampire bat seems determined to gather his own odd hunter pack to fight the problem as its core.<br>The issue being, that problem may be rooted deeper than anyone thought...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051610?t=1774622878","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051610?t=1774622878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/e1a41dae46a97a2e7f4f4b02e5ff0354cb26f4ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774622878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/e1a41dae46a97a2e7f4f4b02e5ff0354cb26f4ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774622878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras/7779347b4db845615ea95549bdfed646.avif?t=1774622878\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/extras_big/7779347b4db845615ea95549bdfed646.webp?t=1774622878 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Tactical-RPG</strong> where you <strong>customize each attack</strong> by mixing <strong>magic ingredients</strong> together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INGREDIENTS COMBO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051610/